obs-browser-hid (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - obs-browser-hid: OBS plugin installed in the OBS 33+ third-party
      plugin path (/usr/lib/<multiarch>/obs-modules/plugins), with its
      manifest under /usr/share/obs/obs-modules/plugins/obs-browser-hid.
    - ws-obs: command-line client for the vendor requests.

